<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-SPRINGBOKS LOSE FIRST FRENCH TOUR MATCH 30-22.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SPRINGBOKS LOSE FIRST FRENCH TOUR MATCH 30-22.</headline>
<dateline>BRIVE, France 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Barbarians beat</p>
<p>South Africa 30-22 (halftime 27-12) in the opening match of the</p>
<p>Springboks' tour of France on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>French Barbarians - Tries: Marc Dal Maso, David Venditti,</p>
<p>Laurent Mazas. Conversions: Sebastian Viars 3. Penalties: Viars</p>
<p>3.</p>
<p>South Africa - Tries: Theo Oosthuizen 2, Johan Erasmus,</p>
<p>Russell Bennett. Conversion: Franco Smith.</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
</text>
